{"seq":7,"slug":"interpreters-vms","title":"解释器与虚拟机","stage":"DONE","category":"editors-compilers","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 解释器与虚拟机\n\n同一段源代码，可以被逐节点求值，也可以被压成字节码逐条解释，还可以在跑热之后编成原生机器码直接交给 CPU。这三种命运并不互斥——一个现代运行时常常让同一段代码在它的生命周期里依次经历这几种待遇。这个 hub 要讲清楚的，就是这条从\"纯解释\"到\"激进编译\"的连续光谱，以及工程师在光谱的每一个落点上面对的真实取舍。\n\n整个 hub 沿四条主线层层递进，每一章都建立在前一章之上。第一章\"解释器基础\"从最根本的执行模型讲起，先把解释与编译的真正分界、四种执行策略的取舍坐标系立起来，再走过最朴素的树遍历解释器，看清它的优雅与性能死角，最后引出字节码与虚拟机——把树压平成线性指令流，这一步是从玩具迈向生产级运行时的分水岭。\n\n第二章\"虚拟机设计\"把这台抽象机器拆开细看。操作数该放在隐式的栈上还是显式的寄存器里，决定了字节码的形态与分派次数；解释循环里那个每秒上亿次的\"跳到下一条指令\"该怎么做得最快，是分派技术的战场；而被指令操作的栈帧、值表示、调用约定这些运行时数据结构，则是一切高级控制流特性的物质基础。\n\n第三章\"内存与运行时\"转向堆。垃圾回收如何判定并收回不再可达的对象、对象如何被快速分配并紧凑布局、解释器层还有哪些不靠 JIT 就能拿到的便宜提速——这三者共同决定了运行时的吞吐与延迟，也直接划出了 JIT 该在哪里接手的边界。\n\n第四章\"即时编译\"跨过那条边界，收束整条主线。JIT 怎么发现热点、怎么把字节码编成原生码，内联缓存与类型反馈如何成为它激进特化的眼睛，分层编译与去优化又如何让这种激进既快又不出错。读到最后会发现，第一章那句\"同一段代码在光谱上动态游走\"，正是由分层编译与去优化完整兑现的。建议从第一章顺序读下来，因为后面每一篇都在回收前面埋下的概念。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"解释器基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interpretation-models","title":"解释执行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/foundations/interpretation-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tree-walking","title":"树遍历解释器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/foundations/tree-walking"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bytecode-vm","title":"字节码与虚拟机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/foundations/bytecode-vm"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"vm-design","title":"虚拟机设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/vm-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stack-register-vm","title":"栈式与寄存器式 VM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/vm-design/stack-register-vm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"instruction-dispatch","title":"指令分派技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/vm-design/instruction-dispatch"},{"seq":3,"slug":"runtime-data-structures","title":"运行时数据结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/vm-design/runtime-data-structures"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"runtime","title":"内存与运行时","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/runtime","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"garbage-collection","title":"垃圾回收基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/runtime/garbage-collection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"allocation-object-model","title":"内存分配与对象模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/runtime/allocation-object-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"runtime-optimization","title":"运行时优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/runtime/runtime-optimization"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"jit","title":"即时编译","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/jit","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"jit-principles","title":"JIT 编译原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/jit/jit-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inline-cache-feedback","title":"内联缓存与类型反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/jit/inline-cache-feedback"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tiered-deopt","title":"分层编译与去优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/jit/tiered-deopt"}]}]}